     - None of these are "abc". So "bca" is NO.
5. "cab":
   - $s[0]$='c', $s[1]$='a', $s[2]$='b'.
   - Swap 0,1 -> "acb".
   - Swap 0,2 -> "bac".
   - Swap 1,2 -> "cba".
